///
///   \brief Deduce template arguments from call arguments.
///
///   \detail
///     Distinct from Monomorphization: deduction decides *what* to
///     instantiate, monomorphization does the instantiating. Handles
///     partial explicit argument lists, pack deduction, and deduction
///     failure as a non-error SFINAE-style signal so overload resolution
///     can discard the candidate rather than diagnose.
